"""One-step installer for the Deep-Live-Cam "smoother live swap" update.

Adds: the official "Async swap" option (upstream #1957), face tracking/smoothing, skin-tone matching (steady when you raise a
hand), sharper face detail, the picture's hair and ears locked to your
head, hiding your own hair/ears, and tools/make_hair_mask.py.

Run it from your Deep-Live-Cam folder (or just put this file in that folder
and double-click install_smoother_live_swap.bat on Windows):

    python install_smoother_live_swap.py          install
    python install_smoother_live_swap.py --undo   put the old files back

Safe by design:
* every file it changes is backed up first (folder backup_smoother_swap_<time>);
* it never overwrites a file you edited yourself -- if one of the files it
  needs differs from the original Deep-Live-Cam version, it tries a careful
  git merge, and if that isn't possible it stops without changing anything;
* afterwards it checks that everything compiles and runs the self-tests.
"""

